==English==

===Etymology===
{{bor|en|frm|inimitable}}, from {{der|en|la|inimitabilis}}, corresponding to {{affix|en|in-|imitable}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈɪmɪtəbl̩/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|?}}

# Beyond [[imitation]], [[surpassing]] all others, [[matchless]].

====Usage notes====
Not to be confused with {{m|en|inimicable||[[inimical]], harmful, hostile}}.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|inimitability}}
* {{l|en|inimitably}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|imitable}}
* {{l|en|commonplace}}

